# curl_cffi

TLS impersonation for research scraping. Bundled fingerprints handle
challenges from Akamai, DataDome, Kasada and Incapsula with no browser
automation: simple API calls that generate valid antibot tokens and
bypass challenge pages to obtain verified cookies.
